[profiles.guide]
notes = '''Hold {lt} for bullet time. Hold {rb} with a direction on the left stick {ls} to shootdodge, and let go to stand back up.
{north} takes a painkiller. {south} uses doors, switches and phones, and {east} jumps.
Hold {lb} for the weapon groups, aiming with the right stick {rs}. The {dpad} left and right step through the weapons.
Click {r3} for the secondary attack: a melee strike, or a grenade or Molotov without switching weapons. {up} is the sniper zoom.
Crouch is a toggle: click {l3} to crouch and again to stand.
{start} is the menu. Double tap it to quick save and hold it to quick load. {select} pauses without the menu.
With gyro aiming, hold {down} to pause the gyro while you reposition the controller.'''

